      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Neon Dreams at Devour! Studios"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>Doors: 7:00 p.m. | Show: 8:00 p.m.</p>\n<p>Canadian electro-pop favourites <a href='https://www.neondreams.ca/' target='_blank'>Neon Dreams</a> bring their high-energy, feel-good live show to Devour! Studios for one unforgettable night. Known for chart-topping hits, infectious hooks, and an uplifting message that has earned them a devoted fan base globally, Neon Dreams deliver a concert experience that is equal parts dance party and celebration of community. Join us in the heart of Wolfville for an intimate evening of music, connection, and unforgettable moments at Devour! Studios.</p>\n\n<p><b>Please note:</b> This is a 19+ event. Valid government-issued photo identification is required for entry.</p>\n\n<p><b>About the Venue: Devour! </b><br>\nDevour! Studios is a dynamic cultural and culinary hub housed in a former apple warehouse, featuring a state-of-the-art teaching kitchen, event hall, and performance venue. Open year-round, it fosters creativity through various educational programming, including hosting the 16th Devour! Food Film Fest from October 19-25, 2026, in Wolfville. The Studios are also available for rent; more details are available at <a href='https://devourstudios.com/' target='_blank'>devourstudios.com</a>. \n</p>\n\n\n\n<style>\n.location-page-temp {display: block!important;}\n</style>"
      }
