        "@value": "<p>Access to all shows in TD Main Venue, Barracks and Hoodoo House of Blues from Sept. 16-19th. Platinum Pass gives you access to the TD Main Stage VIP area with sightlines to the stage, your own private bar (with two complimentary drinks on us), special Platinum Ultimate VIP Lanyard, Complimentary ticket to Steph Strings, private bathroom, private water cooler, private seating and fast track entrance. </p>\n\n<p>Please note that this pass is for <b>AGES 19+</b>.</p>\n\n\n<style>\n.location-page-temp {display: none!important;}\n</style>\n\n"
