    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Ladies of the Canyon"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>Joni Mitchell, Mama Cass, Crosby, Stills and Nash, Carole King, The Eagles - these are just a handful of the extraordinary songwriters who took up residence in the legendary neighbourhood of Laurel Canyon in California. Located just outside Los Angeles, this artist commune created a musical alchemy that birthed some of the greatest songs and artists of the 20th Century. </p>\n\n<p><b>Alicia Toner and Mike Ross</b> have created one of Harmony House's signature docu-concerts, taking you on a deep dive into the music of this unique time and place that produced music that became the soundtrack of our lives. </p>\n\n<p>Featuring four of Atlantic Canada's most electric artists - <b>Brielle Ansems, Emilea May, Robin Anne Ettles, and Alicia Toner</b> - this distinguished quartet of will tell us the story of this incredible time in music history and celebrate the songs that came out of Laurel Canyon. </p>\n\n<p>Join us at Harmony House this summer for -<i> Ladies of the Canyon</i>\n</p>\n<p><b>If you would like to make a reservation to enjoy dinner before the show, please call the venue at: 902-964-2255 or email them at <a href='mailto:harmonyhousePEIresos@gmail.com'>harmonyhousePEIresos@gmail.com</a>!<br>Please note: On 2pm matinee days, The Lounge is open for dinner reservations 3:30pm onward, after the 2pm performance.<br><br>\nFor ticket details, visit Harmony House Theatre on-line at <a href='https://harmonyhousepei.com/' target='_blank'><u>harmonyhousepei.com</u></a> or call the box office at 1-888-311-9090.</i></b></p>\n\n\n<p><b>Harmony House Gift Certificates are not redeemable through Ticketpro. Please contact Harmony House directly to redeem.</b></p>\n\n<p><b><font size='+1'>TICKET PURCHASES ARE FINAL AND NON-REFUNDABLE</b></font></p>\n\n<style>\n.location-page-temp {\n    display: block!important;\n}\n</style>\n\n\n"
