    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Curtain Call Players Present: Steel Magnolias by Robert Harling"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>Steel Magnolias explores the deep sisterhood and resilience of a tight-knit group of women. From the energetic salon owner, Truvy, to the fiercely devoted mother, M'Lynn, the characters navigate life's triumphs and heartbreaks together. The title perfectly reflects the core theme: the women are as delicate as blossoms, but as tough as steel. Throughout the story, the salon transforms into a sanctuary of laughter, gossip, and mutual support. Their unbreakable friendships ultimately provide the strength they need to endure a devastating loss.</p>\n\n\n<style>\n.location-page-temp {display: block!important;}\n@media screen and (max-width: 600px){iframe{width:100%;}}\n</style>\n\n"
      }
    ],
