    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://tproatlantic.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/1698308564/performances/FSP18DM27"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "The Island Jubilee Old Time Radio Music Show - Tribute Series"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p><b>Season V: Tribute Series - Honouring Country Music Legends</b></p>\n\n<p>Season V brings a new twist: every show is a fan-voted tribute to country music legends.  Enjoy timeless hits by your favourite artists, as chosen by our fans during Season IV who know them best. Experience the timeless songs of top picks like Dolly Parton, Johnny Cash, George Jones, Anne Murray, Charley Pride, Patsy Cline, Merle Haggard, Loretta Lynn, Kenny Rogers, Hank Snow, Conway Twitty, Hank Williams, George Strait, Willie Nelson, The Carter Family, John Denver, Gordon Lightfoot, Tammy Wynette, and many more chosen by you, our fans.  It's your favourites, your voices, and the music you love-brought to life on our stage this season.</p>\n\n<p>Step back in time with the Island Jubilee Old Time Radio Music Show—an unforgettable celebration of classic country that captures the spirit and sound of radio's golden age. Co-hosted by award-winning artist Janet McGarry and Serge Bernard, the show features the outstanding Jubilee All-Stars: Thomas Webb (steel guitar), Bobby McIsaac (guitars), Johnny Ross (piano), Jason Burbine (bass), and Courtney Hogan-Chandler (fiddle). Beloved country radio personality Randy Geddes of Tantramar 107.9 FM brings it all together as MC with his signature warmth and energy.</p>\n\n<p>Drawing inspiration from legendary broadcasts like Louisiana Hayride, Jamboree USA, and the Grand Ole Opry, each performance is recorded live for radio and aired on Tantramar 107.9 FM (CFTA). Past shows are also available at <a href='http://www.tantramarfm.ca/' target='_blank'>www.tantramarfm.ca</a>.</p>\n\n<p>'An authentic Opry experience' - Ron Bickle - Radio Broadcaster -Tantramar 107.9 FM CFTA . </p>\n\n\n</p>\n<style>\n.location-page-temp {\n    display: block!important;\n}\n</style>\n"
      }
    ],
