    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://tproatlantic.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/1694494744/performances/AST07KS26"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "The Coldplay Show - (Ultimate Hits Experience)"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>Coldplay are recognized worldwide as one of the most popular and influential bands of the new millennium, with 160 million albums sold. They have been performing for more than 25 years, selling out multiple nights in almost every venue, thrilling dedicated fans numbered in the millions.</p>\n\n<p>'The Coldplay Show' is the most authentic tribute, bringing the closest sonic and visual performance experience imaginable, featuring the biggest hits of all-time that include: Clocks, Scientist, Adventure of a Lifetime, Sky Full of Stars, Yellow, Paradise, Fix You, Something Just Like This, My Universe, Higher Power, Trouble and other recognizable chart-toppers.</p>\n\n<p>A show that includes high-tech 3D visual elements bringing to life the true essence of the renowned Coldplay show, with truly professional band members who are seasoned tribute musicians, who have performed 1000's of shows at various festivals, theatres and live music venues.</p>\n\n<p>The Coldplay Show delivers compelling vocal stylings and a dynamic stage presence that leaves audiences of all ages feeling emotionally charged. A musical experience that you would expect from Coldplay frontman Chris Martin, himself.</p>\n\n<p>Testimonial: ''It's all there...the voice, the sound, the songs and amazing visuals.'' - Larry Sylvain - The Port Theatre (Theatre Owner/Programming Director - Cornwall, Ontario, Canada)'</p>\n\n\n<iframe width='560' height='315' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/orh71tqhVLs?si=VFBseDRsIi9Xq0o8' title='YouTube video player' frameborder='0' allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share' referrerpolicy='strict-origin-when-cross-origin' allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<style>\n\n@media screen and (max-width:728px) {\niframe{width:100%!important;}\n}\n</style>"
      }
    ],
