      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Mike Greenwood's MAXOUT Life Stand Up Comedy Tour"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>Join us for Mike Greenwood's <b>MAXOUT LIFE Tour</b>, as he delivers high-energy storytelling, sharp self-deprecating punchlines, and big, relatable laughs.</p><br>\n\n<p>Alternating between headlining his own tour and a cross-continent theatre tour with Pete Correale, Mike is building major momentum, with tour dates across the globe in [2026] and [2027]. Pete Correale calls Mike 'f-ing funny and fun,' and audiences agree.</p><br>\n\n<p>Mike has appeared at the Winnipeg Comedy Festival where he hosted the hit show Comedy + Magic, performed at Just For Laughs Vancouver, and appeared on Comedy Here Often's Great Canadian Comedy Rumble.</p><br>\n\n<p>His bits are also regular favorites on SiriusXM, and he will be taping his new album, MAXOUT LIFE, in January [2027].</p><br>\n\n<p>Come see why DJ Lou from SiriusXM's The Bonfire says, 'I love this guy!'</p><br>\n\n"
      }
    ],
