    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p><b>Back By Popular Demand! These three nights Sold Out months in advance last year.</b></p> \n\n<p>Welcome to THE GRAND TOUR - a timeless journey through classic country music! Join us for electrifying performances of hits from the 50's, 60's, 70's, and 80's. The Grand Tour With A Dash of Christmas show includes a few classic Country Christmas songs to get you in the spirit!</p> \n\n<p>Experience the soulful voices of George Jones, Johnny Cash, Conway Twitty, Jim Reeves, Charley Pride and much more, brought to life with fresh energy and passion. These talented musicians will have you remembering the days when you would sing along to the radio!</p> \n\n<p>Don't miss this nostalgic celebration of country music's rich heritage! For more information, visit <a href='https://thegrandtour.ca/' target='_blank'>www.thegrandtour.ca</a></p>  \n\n\n<iframe width='560' height='315' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/MBtX3mupukk?si=vl6vNcYlONAe30NI' title='YouTube video player' frameborder='0' allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share' referrerpolicy='strict-origin-when-cross-origin' allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<style>\n.location-page-temp {\n    display: block!important;}\n@media screen and (max-width: 600px){iframe{width:100%;}}\n</style>"
