      {
        "@id": "https://tproatlantic.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/1699818371/performances/MCC11CS27"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Duo Homard - Debut Atlantic Classical Series"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>Homard Duo features two brilliant musicians originally from southeastern New Brunswick: flutist Phoebe Robertson and pianist Pierre-André Doucet. Their group is named in homage to the humble lobster, an emblem of Atlantic Canada, but also to a Middle English term for returning home. Collaborators since 2020, Phoebe and Pierre-André delight in bringing repertoire for flute and piano to audiences of all ages and backgrounds. Their previous collaborations have taken a variety of formats ranging from lecture-recital demonstrations to a performance in the Été musical de Barachois. Each now based in their own region of North America, Phoebe and Pierre-André remain united by their enthusiasm for performing and collaborating with one another.</p><br>\n\n<style>\n@media screen and (max-width: 600px){iframe{width:100%;}}\n</style>"
      }
    ],
